# [변경] P12: Right path is checked by turnRight()+front recheck, then all-blocked recovery stays active.
power
start
# [추가] front/left blocked, right path clear after turnRight front recheck.
obstacle_right_clear
expect_mode NormalMode
expect_motor on
expect_cleaner on
expect_boost off
expect_direction Forward
# [변경] all blocked means front/left blocked and right/front recheck also blocked.
obstacle_all
expect_mode NormalMode
expect_motor on
expect_cleaner on
expect_boost off
expect_direction Backward
